pilferage. But there was little else to be done.

229
00:18:20,160 --> 00:18:23,840
Loading may have been manual labor, but it took

230
00:18:23,841 --> 00:18:24,541
skill.

231
00:18:24,542 --> 00:18:29,800
For shippers, it was better to lose a little to the longshoremen than everything to the sea.

232
00:18:30,880 --> 00:18:35,161
If you improperly load a vessel then or now, you're likely to have an accident.

233
00:18:35,162 --> 00:18:35,862
You can

234
00:18:35,863 --> 00:18:40,455
compromise the stability. You can overload it so it sinks when water comes on board.

