00:19:15,260 --> 00:19:16,776
And those yards work as cranes.

247
00:19:16,777 --> 00:19:19,760
They're sort of built-in cranes that are already on the ship.

248
00:19:19,940 --> 00:19:23,360
So it makes it easier for the sailors because they have that high vantage point.

249
00:19:23,640 --> 00:19:27,160
They can set up a block and tackle to that and therefore lift the stuff on and off

