00:24:48,720 --> 00:24:51,620
But many rail workers never get to see what they're moving.

323
00:24:53,060 --> 00:24:59,540
As with other forms of transportation, the sealed steel container has revolutionized the railroad loading dock.

324
00:25:01,820 --> 00:25:08,320
Rail workers at the Eagle Marine Intermodal Container Transfer Facility, connected to the Los Angeles Long Beach Harbor,

325
00:25:09,280 --> 00:25:11,240
put together two or more trains a day.

