00:27:40,021 --> 00:27:45,380
was important so we find the erection of permanent cranes next to railroad depots and in railroad

351
00:27:45,381 --> 00:27:51,980
yards becoming a part of the landscape. Shortly after the war on May 10, 1869,

352
00:27:51,981 --> 00:27:57,320
at Promontory Summit, Utah, dignitaries drove the last and golden spike of the

