00:27:57,321 --> 00:28:01,520
Transcontinental Railroad, an ever-expanding web of tracks spread

354
00:28:01,521 --> 00:28:06,920
across the nation. The railroad's speed and efficiency had a profound effect on

355
00:28:06,921 --> 00:28:11,440
the mining industry. Mine owners throughout the country began to work

356
00:28:11,441 --> 00:28:16,440
numerous ore, mineral, and coal deposits once deemed inaccessible.

357
00:28:16,441 --> 00:28:23,440
Coal mines were developed so that the chutes out of the mine itself were at an elevated level.

358
00:28:23,441 --> 00:28:30,440
So it was actually a teeny railroad that brought the coal in small bins up out of the mine.

